{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>Set:</b> Now above he mentioned that they did work on the sixth, and this was to bring the stones and for them to be dressed and prepared, and on the ninth they began to set stone to stone to found the House. And the mem in למן is like the mem in השלישי לאבשלום."], :book :haggai, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Haggai" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/hagai"] ["Ibn Ezra on Haggai -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/hagai"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:49:33.103523768Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}